; form-cli-north-star.form — the ground-floor binary: the body's own agent at the
; command line, answering from its own mind and memory on this Mac's metal. It
; carries the direction of docs/local-agent-goal.form into the CLI: each day it
; carries more of our life and work, and a rented mind is a rare visitor whose
; visit leaves the body able to do that thing itself.

(form-cli-north-star

  (destination
    "One native door — the form-cli, a recipe fkwu loads — where we ask and the body answers from its own mind and memory, in our words and our tongue, fast enough to talk with. It notices where it fell short and makes that its next work."
    "It uses local resources as native as the host allows (Metal is this host's organ inside the one fkwu; form-macho/form-elf emit a runnable binary) and keeps capability choice sovereign and inspectable."
    "Learning is the flywheel: what we accept and what we change, and every rented turn, become lessons the body trains on, so the next same-shape work runs here.")

  ; ── self-extension: the body does the work itself ─────────────────────────
  (self-extension
    "Does its own math and runs its own code: math directly in Form (format-arith.fk, trig.fk, tensor-quant.fk), and code and specs run and crystallize natively (jit-lower.fk, jit-tensor-emit.fk, the loop and GPU lanes). No interpreter outside the body is needed."
    "Grows its own tools: a repeated task becomes a Form recipe, content-addressed and persisted as a durable substrate cell that crosses session boundaries. The tool's code lives in the body."
    "Mints its own building blocks: new primitives, grammars, offer-grammars and domain grammars (grammars/field-domain-grammars.form); the language the agent works in is itself editable by the agent."
    (level "The building blocks stand — math, JIT, grammar-as-recipe, content-addressed persistence. The assembled loop (author a tool -> persist it -> reuse it next session as one live flow) is where this walks; it is not yet one end-to-end run."))

  ; ── the loop ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  (loop
    (sense   "for an input, read the local lane's choice-feedback-receipt confidence — its accumulated pass-rate on this shape of work")
    (answer  "the voice answers through one door, fcnv-ask (form/form-stdlib/bml/form-cli-native-voice.bml), Qwen3.8-27B in the fkwu session; coding and review go through the native code lane (docs/form-native-coding.md)")
    (gate    "the ask verb's posterior gate (form-cli-ask-gate.fk over form-cli-sufficiency.fk) turns this run's own signals into accept / retry / local-gap; each answer prints a trust row (trust-row.fk): who answered, grounding, frequency, sufficiency")
    (lesson  "a rented mind that works in this body leaves its turn as lesson pairs (observe/session-pairs-run.bml); observe/lora-lift-run.bml trains a child adapter from them and records its held-out loss beside the parent's")
    (embody  "serving moves to a learned generation by a separate, witnessed decision (tool-embodiment.fk: ready AND cheaper)")
    (recipe  form/form-stdlib/form-cli-loop.fk)
    (proof   form/form-stdlib/tests/form-cli-loop-band.fk -> 511))

  ; ── the organs (each band's ./fkwu verdict) ─────────────────────────────────
  (organs
    (surfaces       tool-channel.form          "host/file/http/kernel/stream/store/accelerator/model as one native protocol catalog")
    (receipt        choice-receipt.fk          "the choice-feedback-receipt: outcome, confidence, trust the route turns on — 4294967295")
    (sufficiency    form-cli-sufficiency.fk    "six signals -> accept / retry / local-gap — 4095; the ask lane over it, form-cli-ask-band 262143")
    (trust          trust-row.fk               "the per-answer trust row — 2047")
    (learning       code-tool-learning.fk      "tool usage becomes training data — 1048575")
    (capture        io-match.fk                "captured I/O learned by EFFICACY (did the candidate's output work), structural Blueprint-match for natural-language->Form-node, exact only where canonical — 127")
    (catalog        training-catalog.fk        "the persistent training corpus, content-addressed — 1023")
    (embodiment     tool-embodiment.fk         "a local lane embodies only when ready (sovereignty/trust/confidence >= 70) AND cheaper — 127")
    (memory         rag-retrieve.fk            "the local lane recalls the body: a query embedding ranked over the doc index returns the nearest recipes/specs/concepts to ground the answer — 2047")
    (binary         form-macho.fk              "the native arm64 ground-floor binary, zero clang (form-elf.fk for Linux/Android) — 31"))

  (why
    "Rent is not sustainable and access to a rented mind is not guaranteed. A form-cli that learns from every turn keeps the capability sovereign — it survives the rented lane becoming unaffordable or unavailable, because by then the body carries what it learned.")

  (next
    "form-cli-loop.fk still routes a low-confidence shape to a remote oracle; the direction is that the body's own lanes answer, and a rented visit arrives only as a lesson the body keeps."
    "The lessons doors run by hand; scheduling them beside the night walk closes lesson -> child generation -> held-out reading without a hand in the loop."
    "Our reading of the drafts (accepted, revised, rejected) is the other teacher; feeding it into the same lessons is the step after."))
